Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 04:22:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] player information: the speakers that a layout lights are
 separated by semicolons

hades.audio.spk is tested by the skin as ";FL;" to find one speaker in the
list without taking the end of ";TFL;" for it. The separator was a comma,
which the condition that tests it would take for the separator of its own
parameters. A semicolon means nothing to it. Tested in both directions
(a layout lights the speakers that it has and no others, the height speakers
are not found in the floor ones).
